OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn fact, BBC Two made a big energy
OL,7,Fsaving before the corporation was
OL,8,Fordered to save power.
OL,9,
OL,10,FBBC Two transmitters were kept shut all
OL,11,Fday when possible. The morning showing
OL,12,Fof Play School was moved to BBC One.
OL,13,
OL,14,FThis almost certainly saved far more
OL,15,Fpower directly than the early
OL,16,Fclosedowns.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12906
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F129A1768741149
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile ` despite the need to save
OL,7,Ffuel ` BBC One was free to show the
OL,8,Ftest card all morning as usual during
OL,9,Fthe school holidays.
OL,10,
OL,11,FIt would be interesting to know if
OL,12,Fconsideration was given to an enforced
OL,13,Fdaytime closedown.
OL,14,
OL,15,FNothing before lunchtime and from 2pm `
OL,16,F4pm?
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
